<title>USA: Titan Corp wins Navy awards.</title>
<headline>Titan Corp wins Navy awards.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titan Corp said it received new awards from the U.S. Navy that could total as much as $25.3 million over the next five years.</p>
<p>The value of the contract for 1997 is $5 million, it said.</p>
<p>Under the contract, Titan will provide engineering, analytical, logistics and technical support for submarine undersea warfare and electronic systems and equipment to the Fleet Technical Support Center, Atlantic.</p>
</text>
